  "scope": "Two upright separated cartons. The physics replay reruns perception, planning, gripper drives, contact, retreat and verification using previously sampled unmodified model poses matched to fresh visual clouds. The model was not resampled during those replays. Runs span successive fixes. Locked poses do not fix Isaac physics or runtime timing.",
