    "method": "Re-fit the saved synchronized RGB-D and masks using prior observed body relation plus nominal lift displacement as the correspondence hint. The strict independent fit failed in both; the new carry fit recovered measured orientation and two coordinates, with the long axis explicitly constrained by the grasp. Offline sensitivity test; the full physics replays below run their own image-time FK."
